<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Hey&nbsp;{{{Recipient.FirstName}}} --&nbsp;{{{Sender.FirstName}}} here at EverQuote.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>EverQuote has been a partner of Farmers since 2016. We know a thing or two because we've seen a thing or two! This play on words applies to both business sides. Farmers has gone through a bunch of changes in the past year and some of those changes affect EverQuote. The return on your investment is paramount to us and to achieve this we need to maintain a pulse on your market. Our organization each day looks for better ways at positioning Farmers Agencies to get&nbsp;in front of quality customers. Though quality can be subjective and situational, what you pay to acquire a policy isn't.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Our telemarketing continues to be a heavy hitter for our agents and we have an abundance of solid testimonials to support that. This is not where it stops, we've included a new filter to one of our leads that will increase your selling power while lowering your cost per acquisition. This was drummed up based on Farmers agents requesting for more and now it's here. "We need to have folks with current insurance to be competitive".&nbsp; EverQuote has now put in place a specific added filter to our standard lead types so that you can have stronger conversations and win more. What's great about this is we're also reducing the price in addition to the added filter!&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<br />
We want you to quote more but it needs to be the right type of quoting and we want this new filter to pave the way for you to build a bigger book. You have been with us before so you know this is also a numbers game. You need a sizable sample of leads to get the quotes in and if you feed the telemarketing platform it will provide you with multiple opportunities daily. If the time is approaching for more activity look no further, this combined effort of reduced&nbsp;lead costs, the telemarketing and added filter is substantial.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
</p>
&nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;
<p>Check out this<a href="https://vimeo.com/664824242"> video</a> for the full rundown.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Quick chat? Schedule a call with me here: {{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Cheers,</p>

<p>{{{Sender.FirstName}}}</p>

<p>{{{Sender.Phone}}}</p>
